
# live.cn
IMAPAccount live
Host 127.0.0.1
Port 1993
User z_fun@live.cn
Pass "dummy123"
AuthMechs LOGIN
TLSType None
Timeout 300
# PassCmd "~/.config/neomutt/mutt_oauth2.py ~/.config/neomutt/live.tokens --provider microsoft"
# AuthMechs XOAUTH2
# SSLType IMAPS

IMAPStore live-remote
Account live

MaildirStore live-local
Path ~/Maildir/live/
Inbox ~/Maildir/live/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel live
Far :live-remote:
Near :live-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

